      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/_GeorgeReid_/status/1978151374941475292",
      "text": "Global Amazon PPC salaries are shifting - fast.\n\nFrom our 5,000+ candidate interviews at Pare, one thing’s clear:\n\nThe world’s best PPC managers aren’t just in the US or UK anymore.\n\n🇲🇽 Mexico and 🇵🇭 the Philippines are climbing fast\n\n🇮🇳 India still delivers unmatched value\n\n🇵🇱 Eastern Europe commands near-Western rates for analytical depth\n\nIt’s not just cost that’s changing.\n\nIt’s how brands think about hiring - balancing skill, communication, and culture instead of chasing the lowest price.\n\nWe built a full salary breakdown by region, plus the Pare Global PPC Value Index to show where the best balance really sits.\n\n👉 Read the full article here:\nhttps://t.co/Oj4OJjtdmb",
